From 5517596f673df22de2823d0637f0cfe87cd735c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dquillman <davequillman@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 17:12:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] a11y: stop the step-5 overlay dimming its own label below
 AA
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Follow-up to the accessibility pass. The "Restarting demo…" label in
InteractiveDemo sat inside a wrapper carrying opacity-40 while step === 5,
which drags the text's computed colour to roughly 2:1 no matter which colour
token it uses. The audit only sees it during that one step, so the same code
scored 100 on one Lighthouse run and 96 on the next — the earlier "100" was a
sampling fluke, not a fix.

The recede now comes from scale-[0.97] alone and the label keeps slate-400
(7.66:1). Three consecutive Lighthouse runs: accessibility 100, zero failures,
no variance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PrwLxrs7UtH64migVzCS5B
---
 web/src/components/InteractiveDemo.tsx | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/web/src/components/InteractiveDemo.tsx b/web/src/components/InteractiveDemo.tsx
index e425cfd..b6fdcee 100644
--- a/web/src/components/InteractiveDemo.tsx
+++ b/web/src/components/InteractiveDemo.tsx
@@ -355,7 +355,12 @@ export default function InteractiveDemo() {
           </div>
 
           {/* ── STEP 5: Pause (reuses step 4 visual, just a gap) ────────── */}
-          <div className={`absolute inset-0 p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-700 ${step === 5 ? 'opacity-40 scale-[0.97]' : 'opacity-0 pointer-events-none'}`}>
+          {/* The dim used to come from opacity-40 on this wrapper, which drags the
+              label's computed colour down to ~2:1 — a contrast failure that only
+              appears while step === 5, so it passes or fails an audit depending on
+              when the sampler happens to land. The recede now comes from scale
+              alone and the text keeps its own colour. */}
+          <div className={`absolute inset-0 p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-700 ${step === 5 ? 'scale-[0.97]' : 'opacity-0 pointer-events-none'}`}>
             <div className="flex items-center justify-center h-full">
               <span className="text-xs text-slate-400">Restarting demo…</span>
             </div>
